[0m
I found a regression: the `toggleCompletion` async block removes the task from `justCompleted` after 0.6s, but never calls `recompute()`. This means `flatNodes` is stale and the completed task stays visible forever (the fade-out animation never plays).
[0m← [0mEdit TaskFlow/Features/Reminders/ViewModels/ListDetailViewModel.swift
Index: /Users/sam/Desktop/TaskFlowApp/TaskFlow/Features/Reminders/ViewModels/ListDetailViewModel.swift
